###############################################################################
# Q12 -- Gaps and ambiguities (prose; not triples)
###############################################################################

# - Energy Pearson correlation coefficients (e.g. r = 0.89 zero-shot) are not R2 values and are not encoded.
# - Variants fine-tuned with dissociated-fragment configurations (on-reaction-coordinate force MAE 12.9 to 28.4 meV/A naive, 11.3 to 11.5 multi-head; energy 0.85 to 1.22 and 0.77 to 1.42 meV/atom) are not encoded as runs: the evaluation subset is not identified beyond 'on-reaction-coordinate'.
# - Fine-tuning hyperparameters are in SI Table S2 (not read). Free-energy surfaces and the binding energy (SI Section S5) are property results.
# - Author affiliations are not encoded (ORCIDs are those deposited with the DOI metadata, source: datacite).
# - Evaluation roles and data, base models, inference timings with their system sizes, and the source location of each value are recorded in the encoding input (artifacts/kg/encoding/specs/mendiblebarreto2026.yaml) until the schema has terms for them.

